---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AffiliateLink from "../../components/AffiliateLink.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Helldivers 2 — Cross-Platform Buying Guide"
  description="Helldivers 2 buying guide: co-op shooter, editions, and where to buy the digital version cheapest on PS5 and PC."
>
  <article class="post">
    <h1>Helldivers 2 — Cross-Platform Buying Guide</h1>
    <p class="meta">PlayStation 5 / PC · Updated 2026-08-05</p>

    <p>
      <strong>Helldivers 2</strong> is the surprise 2024 co-op hit — a satirical,
      squad-based third-person shooter where you and up to three friends spread
      "managed democracy" across a galaxy of bugs and bots.
    </p>

    <h2>Standard vs Super Citizen Edition</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Standard</strong> — the full game, all you need to play</li>
      <li><strong>Super Citizen Edition</strong> — adds a armor set, warbond token, and steeled veterans cosmetics; cosmetic only</li>
      <li><strong>Cross-play</strong> — PS5 and PC players share the same lobbies</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Where to buy cheapest</h2>
    <p>
      Demand keeps pricing firm at launch, but key stores like Green Man Gaming
      occasionally undercut the platform stores. On PC, compare GMG against Steam
      sales; on PS5, compare against PlayStation Store wallet credit.
    </p>

    <ul class="buy-list">
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="gmg"
          href="https://www.greenmangaming.com/search/?q=helldivers+2+ps5"
          cta="Check Green Man Gaming"
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="amazon"
          href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Helldivers+2"
          cta="Check on Amazon"
        />
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="note">
      Prices change frequently — always verify on the store before purchasing.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .post { padding: 1.5rem 0; max-width: 720px; }
  .post h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .buy-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
